# {{ artifact.name }}

GGUF builds of {{ base.repo }} with {{ gguf.n_routed_experts | int }} of {{ artifact.n_routed_base | int }} routed experts kept in every decoder layer, for the llama.cpp fork named in `{{ gguf.manifest_name }}`. They are converted from the published REAP MXFP4 master (keep-set `{{ gguf.keepset_sha256 }}`), then requantized per level.

## Levels

Each level was scored separately on its own GGUF: a paired, teacher-forced comparison of the served file against the cached unpruned teacher on held-out documents ({{ gguf.eval_tokens | int }} scored tokens). Intervals are ninety-five percent document-cluster bootstrap intervals. Only levels that passed the pre-registered GGUF gate are in this repository.

